1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the court records 1725," Lars Olofsson at Berg property demanded for his wife Annika Olofsdotter (that was his wife no 2) and for brother Jonas Olofsson- to inherit 1/4 of "helgiärdshemmanet" property Långnäs"
2 CONC . He moved to Långnäs in Alster about 1725 from Berg in Väse.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had married his second wife Annika Olofsdotter in 1701. She was born in 1679 in Långnäs. Alster parish, Värmland province.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lars Olufsson was a farmer and lived at Berg property in Väse. He moved to property Långnäs in 1725. Långenäs is situated in Alster parish in Värmland (Alster is close to Väse). He was first married to Elin Nilsdotter who was born
2 CONC  1655 at Boxerud property in Väse. She died in 1699 at Berg property in Väse.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Dombok 1725: Påstod Lars Olofsson i Berg, både för sin hustru Annika Olofsdotters arvspart och brodern Jonas Olofsson del att få taga 1/4 uti helgiärdshemmanet Långnäs i besittning af brodern Lars Olofsson i Långenäs broder Olof O
2 CONC lofsson. Utflyttad till Långenäs omkring 1725 från Berg, Väse (S). 
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT 81 år gammal vid sin död
