1 OCCU Rådman i Stockholm Borgmästare
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Johan Leijel''' was an industrialist, a magistrate as well as Trade Mayor of Stockholm, s.v. “[http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borgm%C3%A4stare handelsborgmästare]”. After his cousin Jacob L, he owned Vällnora bruk
2 CONC  in [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knutby_socken Knutby], and for a period, he also disposed the ironworks Strömsberg in Tolfta and Västland in Västland, both in Uppsala.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Student in Uppsala
2 CONT * 1685 Student teacher (auskultant) at Stockholm's town hall and ''kämnersrätt''
2 CONT * 1696-06-30 Ioo  with Catharina Ehrencrona, No. 879 [2 daughters + 2 sons]
2 CONT * 1706 Magistrate (rådman) in Stockholm
2 CONT * 1711-03-19 IIoo with Margaretha Hising [3 daughters + 4 sons]
2 CONT * 1731 Trade Mayor (handelsborgmästare) of Stockholm
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
