2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Dear Al Henderson, I got your request handed over by the Israelitische KultusgemeindeVienna; as long as G. E. Schützer is neither Austrian nor Jewish, we cannot do anything for your research, I regret. (Schuetzer is a v
2 CONC ery common namefor Christians, it has the meanings you mentioned, and people who protect something (the city, the castle etc.) with a weapon are called so already in the Middle ages. For Jews the name is rare). So I suggest that y
2 CONC ou write to the Archive of Hannover ( I do not havethe address, but perhaps the German Embassy can help you). But documents of this time are rare, except the person is a VIP. Nevertheless I wish you success
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Sincerely Martha Keil
