1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''[http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anders_Fredrik_Beckman Anders Fredrik Beckman]''' (October 23, 1812 – September 24, 1894) was the bishop of Härnösand 1865-1875 and Skara in 1875-1894. Ph.D. 1836, docent theoretica
2 CONC l phil. 1837, Th.kand. 1841, lector phil. 1841, lector teol. 1842, Adjunct professor teol. 1847, Th.lic. 1850, professor dogmatic theol. & moral theol. 1851, Th.D. 1860.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1843 to Anna Maria Albertina Grenander (1822-1908). Studies in Uppsala, ordained 1841, “well preacher” at Sätra U, active in Skara & Uppsala. Rector at Uppsala University 1859-1860, Senior Professor of Theology and dean. B
2 CONC ishop in Härnösand 1864-75, later bishop in Skara. Fellow member of the clergy at the parliament 1865-66 & the upper/first chamber 1867-72.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1830 Studerade
2 CONT * 1836 Prom ph mag i Uppsala
2 CONT * 1837 Phil teor docens vid Uppsala academie
2 CONT * 1841 Th dogm et moral docens
2 CONT * 1841 Brunnspredikant i Westmanland
2 CONT * 1841 Phil lect i Skara
2 CONT * 1841-05-27 Prästvigd
2 CONT * 1842 Th lect
2 CONT * 1847 Th adj o pastor i Börje praeb pastorat vid Uppsala Academi
2 CONT * 1848 Prost
2 CONT * 1850 Th lic
2 CONT * 1851 Th dogm
2 CONT * 1851 Moral et symb professor
2 CONT * 1851 Kyrkoherde i Hel Tref Förs Praeb pastorat
2 CONT * 1853 Kyrkoherde i G:a Uppsala Praeb
2 CONT * 1863 Primar Teol professor
2 CONT * 1863 Domprost och kyrkoherde i Uppsala stads praeb samt Waksala praeb
2 CONT * 1864-09-13 Utnämnd till biskop i Härnösand
2 CONT * 1875-08-12 Biskop i Skara
2 CONT
