1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Secondary sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Swedish Census 1900 (2006) / Sveriges befolkning 1900 (2006)
2 CONT
2 CONT Swedish Death Index 1947-2006 (2007) / Sveriges dödbok 4.0 1947-2006 (2007)
